    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d111">

                <pb facs="0171" n="99" xml:id="pg99"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/558.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Bishop Brent to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-01-31"><hi rendition="#italic">January 31,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Gives names of Austrian and Italian delegates to opium conference and says
                    notification of appointment should come through department. Asks names of
                    Chinese commission at present.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
